{"id": 14754, "title": "Girlfriend and boyfriend", "japanese_title": "彼女と彼氏", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "girlfriend-and-boyfriend", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/14754_girlfriend-and-boyfriend.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["A: Is that girl on your phone your girlfriend?", "B: No, she is my college classmate. What do you think of her?", "A: She is beautiful! You see, she has long hair, big eyes, and is tall and thin. Why do you have a picture of her? You like her, right?", "B: Haha, yes, I like her very much. Hope she can really be my girlfriend one day. And you? What kind of boy do you like?", "A: I like boys who are tall, neither fat nor thin, and clean. Of course, he'd better like sports, music and movies. He also has to be smart, kind, and friendly to everyone...", "B: You ask too much! That's why you don't have a boyfriend yet."], "english_full": "A: Is that girl on your phone your girlfriend?\n\nB: No, she is my college classmate. What do you think of her?\n\nA: She is beautiful! You see, she has long hair, big eyes, and is tall and thin. Why do you have a picture of her? You like her, right?\n\nB: Haha, yes, I like her very much. Hope she can really be my girlfriend one day. And you? What kind of boy do you like?\n\nA: I like boys who are tall, neither fat nor thin, and clean. Of course, he'd better like sports, music and movies. He also has to be smart, kind, and friendly to everyone...\n\nB: You ask too much! That's why you don't have a boyfriend yet.", "japanese_paragraphs": ["A：スマホに写ってるあの子、彼女？", "B：違うよ。大学の同級生だよ。どう思う？", "A：きれいだね！ほら、髪が長くて、目が大きくて、背も高くてすらっとしてる。どうしてあの子の写真を持ってるの？好きなんでしょ？", "B：はは、うん、大好きなんだ。いつか本当に彼女になってくれたらいいな。そっちは？どんな男の子が好き？", "A：背が高くて、太りすぎでも痩せすぎでもなくて、清潔感のある男の子が好き。もちろん、スポーツや音楽、映画も好きだといいな。それに、頭がよくて、優しくて、誰にでも気さくで……", "B：注文が多すぎるよ！だから、まだ彼氏がいないんだよ。"], "reading_paragraphs": ["えー： すまほ に うつってる あのこ、 かのじょ？", "びー： ちがうよ。 だいがく の どうきゅうせい だよ。 どう おもう？", "えー： きれい だね！ ほら、 かみ が ながくて、 め が おおきくて、 せ も たかくて すらっと してる。 どうして あのこ の しゃしん を もってる の？ すき なんでしょ？", "びー： はは、 うん、 だいすき なんだ。 いつか ほんとう に かのじょ に なって くれたら いいな。 そっち は？ どんな おとこのこ が すき？", "えー： せ が たかくて、 ふとりすぎ でも やせすぎ でも なくて、 せいけつかん の ある おとこのこ が すき。 もちろん、 すぽーつ や おんがく、 えいが も すき だと いいな。 それに、 あたま が よくて、 やさしくて、 だれ に でも きさく で……", "びー： ちゅうもん が おおすぎる よ！ だから、 まだ かれし が いない んだよ。"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ゆう\" data-defn=\"Excellent (grade)/A; superiority/excellence\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-defn=\"： (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">：</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"すま\" data-defn=\"スマ (loanword / name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">スマ</span><rt>すま</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ほ\" data-defn=\"5th in a sequence denoted by the iroha system/5th note in the diatonic scale (used in key \" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ホ</span><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"うつっ\" data-defn=\"to be photographed/to be projected (写る)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">写っ</span><rt>うつっ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"てる\" data-defn=\"to shine; to look slightly upward (of a noh mask\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">てる</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あの\" data-defn=\"that/those/the\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">あの</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"こ\" data-defn=\"child; young (animal)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">子</span><rt>こ</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かのじょ\" data-defn=\"girlfriend\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">彼女</span><rt>かのじょ</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ベル\" data-defn=\"bell; bel/B\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-